{
 "schema": "combat.recipes.fighter/1",
 "_about": "PARKED: the training dummy's entries in data/combat/recipes.json, under the key `reference`. A fighter data/director/alchemy.json does not list uses his id in lower case, so REFERENCE needs no entry there. Game Design, fighter-pipeline.md section 8: base stats and the common pool, frozen, exempt from the gate on a fighter's own blows. Every piece is one that more than one fighter has posed, and a row of the live pieces table. No heavy of the tier is common, so his B and his launcher are the common pieces that stand in at B's wind-up, as both fighters' did before the tier was posed. No energy piece is common: his bolt and blast in reach have no pool and no rows in the reach block, and go without a piece (the hook reads a missing pool as no piece). Generated from his kit row (docs/combat/pending/roster/identity.candidates.json `reference`, locked in lock.candidates.json, so it stays as it is) by Combat's pool builder. Applied by reference_recipes.py beside it",
